    "projects": [
      {
        "source_text": "1. AI Super Assistant\n• Built an AI-powered automation assistant that executes real-world tasks such as food ordering, ride booking, and music playback using voice commands.\n• Implemented intent detection using NVIDIA API and integrated LLM + RAG to generate step-by-step action plans.\n• Developed a context-aware recommendation system to suggest food, songs, and videos based on user preferences, ratings, location, and time.\n• Added predictive user behavior modeling to proactively recommend actions based on user habits.\n• Implemented Android automation using Kotlin AccessibilityService to perform actions across apps automatically.",
