        "description": "Built an AI-powered automation assistant that executes real-world tasks such as food ordering, ride booking, and music playback using voice commands. Implemented intent detection using NVIDIA API and integrated LLM + RAG to generate step-by-step action plans. Developed a context-aware recommendation system to suggest food, songs, and videos based on user preferences, ratings, location, and time. Added predictive user behavior modeling to proactively recommend actions based on user habits. Implemented Android automation using Kotlin AccessibilityService to perform actions across apps automatically.",
        "technologies": []
      },
      {
        "source_text": "2. Smart Multi-Restaurant Delivery Optimization System\n• Designed a multi-restaurant ordering system that allows customers to order food from multiple nearby restaurants in a single order.\n• Developed a distance-based feasibility algorithm to allow orders only when restaurants are within a defined radius (0–3 km).\n• Implemented route optimization logic to assign one delivery partner to pick up orders from multiple restaurants and deliver them efficiently to the same customer.\n• Built a delivery time prediction model using distance, preparation time, and traffic conditions to improve delivery efficiency and reduce delivery cost.",
