      "text": "AI/ML Virtual Intern\nMay 2023 – July 2023\n• Developed and deployed 3 supervised ML models on AWS SageMaker with real-world datasets (15,000+ rows).\n• Improved prediction accuracy by 18% after hyperparameter tuning and cross-validation.\n• Evaluated model performance using confusion matrix, F1-score, precision, and recall.\n• Automated end-to-end ML workflows using AWS SageMaker, Lambda, and S3, reducing manual deployment time by 40%."
